# Feature modules

Put every NestJS feature module in `tenora-api/src/modules/<name>/`. Do not add new feature modules next to `app.module.ts`.

Keep infrastructure where it is:

- `src/config/` — environment and configuration
- `src/database/` — TypeORM DataSource, migrations, and connection module
- `src/health/` — liveness and readiness

## New module layout

```
src/modules/<name>/
  <name>.module.ts
  <name>.controller.ts
  <name>.service.ts
  entities/
  dto/
  enums/
```

Register the module in `src/app.module.ts` with `TypeOrmModule.forFeature`. Use the TypeORM `EntityManager` (or `@InjectRepository`) in the service — do not add a custom repository class.

Schema changes go in `src/database/migrations/` as TypeORM migrations. Keep `synchronize: false`. Register new migrations in `src/database/data-source.ts`.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
src/users/users.module.ts
src/users/users.repository.ts

// ✅ GOOD
src/modules/users/users.module.ts
src/modules/users/entities/user.entity.ts
```
